column14:
Continue to Extend the language connection; 
Provide rich, thematic vocabulary words during block play for students to hear
Thank you for the visit

The following is Mr. Conklin ONT (Questioning) feedback;

Encourage students to add additional responses when called upon and continue to use Accountable Talk Stem Sentence Frames during your conversation in both small/whole group discussions.

Reflect on the following;

When posing open-ended questions to students, are they reasoning and persevering on their responses and referring to the text?
